[CustomMessages]
en.TypeBasic=Basic (Siril + RAW + GUI/MCP)
zh_CN.TypeBasic=基础安装（Siril + RAW + GUI/MCP）
en.TypeFull=Full installation (all available optional components)
zh_CN.TypeFull=完整安装（所有可选组件）
en.TypeCustom=Custom
zh_CN.TypeCustom=自定义
en.ComponentBase=Core runtime (about 290 MB downloaded during installation)
zh_CN.ComponentBase=基础运行环境（安装时下载约 290 MB）
en.ComponentFinite=Siril - Aester improved build (recommended; source included)
zh_CN.ComponentFinite=Siril · Aester 改进构建（推荐，含对应源码）
en.ComponentGimp=GIMP 3.2.6 - required for natural-language retouching (190 MB download; separate installation, retained on Aester uninstall)
zh_CN.ComponentGimp=GIMP 3.2.6 · 自然语言修图所需（下载约190 MB；独立安装，卸载Aester时保留）
en.ComponentRetouchSkill=Retouch skill - application-local source and ZIP for your Agent (no global skill installation)
zh_CN.ComponentRetouchSkill=修图技能包 · 应用内源码与ZIP，建议Agent加载（不安装到全局技能目录）
en.DesktopIcon=Create a desktop shortcut
zh_CN.DesktopIcon=创建桌面快捷方式
en.Launch=Launch Aester
zh_CN.Launch=启动 Aester
en.MaintenanceBusy=Another Aester installer or uninstaller is still running. Please wait for it to finish.
zh_CN.MaintenanceBusy=另一个 Aester 安装或卸载窗口仍在工作，请等待其完成。
en.PrepareTitle=Preparing Aester
zh_CN.PrepareTitle=准备 Aester 运行环境
en.PrepareDescription=Files come from the official server or a listed mirror, whichever is faster, each verified by SHA-256. Downloads can resume.
zh_CN.PrepareDescription=从官方服务器或所列镜像中较快的一处下载，每个文件都按 SHA-256 校验；下载可断点续传。
en.VerifyComponents=Preparing and verifying components
zh_CN.VerifyComponents=正在准备并校验组件
en.OtherDirectory=Aester is already installed for this user in:%n%1%n%nUpgrade in that folder or uninstall it first. This installation has not replaced its registration.
zh_CN.OtherDirectory=此用户已在另一目录安装 Aester：%n%1%n%n请在原目录升级，或先卸载原安装；本次不会覆盖原登记。
en.ExtractPython=Extracting the private Python runtime
zh_CN.ExtractPython=解包官方私有 Python
en.PrivatePython=Your system Python, PATH and global settings are unchanged.
zh_CN.PrivatePython=不修改系统 Python、PATH 或全局设置
en.InstallBusy=Aester or a background job is using this installation. Close it or wait for completion, then try again. No downloads or program replacements have started.
zh_CN.InstallBusy=Aester 或后台作业仍在使用此安装，请先退出或等待任务完成。尚未开始下载或覆盖程序。
en.PrepareFailed=Component preparation failed; the active version has not changed. Retry to reuse the download cache. Details: %1
zh_CN.PrepareFailed=组件准备失败，尚未切换安装版本。可重试并复用下载缓存。详情：%1
en.InspectFailed=Uninstall checks failed. No program files have been deleted. Repair the installation and try again.
zh_CN.InspectFailed=卸载预检查失败。尚未删除程序；请修复安装后重试。
en.KeepPhotos=Your finished images, original photographs and unowned files will be kept.
zh_CN.KeepPhotos=卸载将保留作品、原始照片和未归属文件。
en.UninstallTitle=Uninstall Aester
zh_CN.UninstallTitle=卸载 Aester
en.BeginUninstall=Uninstall
zh_CN.BeginUninstall=开始卸载
en.CancelUninstall=Cancel
zh_CN.CancelUninstall=取消
en.ClearCache=Remove large cache files from completed jobs
zh_CN.ClearCache=清理已完成作业的大文件缓存
en.CacheNote=Those jobs can no longer be resumed or have trails reviewed. Original photographs and exported images stay safe.
zh_CN.CacheNote=清理后不能恢复这些作业或复核亮迹；原片和独立保存的作品保留。
en.ClearSettings=Remove Aester preferences
zh_CN.ClearSettings=清理 Aester 界面与目录设置
en.SettingsNote=Only known Aester preferences are removed. Other applications and unknown settings are left alone.
zh_CN.SettingsNote=仅删除 Aester 已知偏好项，不影响其他软件或未知设置。
en.UninstallFailed=Uninstall could not finish. A file may be in use or unavailable. The uninstall entry has been kept; close relevant jobs and try again.
zh_CN.UninstallFailed=卸载未完成。程序或后台任务可能仍在使用，或文件暂时不可删除。已保留卸载入口，请关闭相关任务后重试。
en.ActivationFailed=Aester verification failed and activation did not complete. Details: %1
zh_CN.ActivationFailed=Aester 安装校验失败，未完成激活。详情：%1
en.LanguageWriteFailed=Could not save the installation language. Repair the installation and try again.
zh_CN.LanguageWriteFailed=无法保存安装语言，请修复安装后重试。
en.HelperChanged=Uninstall support changed. Repair the installation before trying again.
zh_CN.HelperChanged=卸载助手已改变，请修复安装后再试。
en.HelperCopyFailed=Could not prepare the independent uninstall helper.
zh_CN.HelperCopyFailed=无法准备独立卸载助手。
en.CancelPrepareConfirm=Aester is still preparing its components. Cancel the installation?%n%nFinished downloads are kept and reused next time. If the official GIMP installer is running, Setup stops after it finishes.
zh_CN.CancelPrepareConfirm=Aester 仍在准备组件。确定要取消安装吗？%n%n已下载的文件会保留，下次安装时复用。若 GIMP 官方安装程序正在运行，会等它结束后再停止。
en.PrepareCancelled=Installation cancelled. Nothing was switched to a new version. Finished downloads are kept in:%n%1%nand are reused when you install again. You can now close Setup.
zh_CN.PrepareCancelled=安装已取消，未切换到新版本。已下载的文件保留在：%n%1%n再次安装时会复用。现在可以关闭安装程序。
en.ExtractFinite=Unpacking the Siril - Aester improved build
zh_CN.ExtractFinite=正在解包 Siril · Aester 改进构建
en.ExtractFiniteDetail=Included with this installer; no download needed. This takes a few seconds.
zh_CN.ExtractFiniteDetail=安装包内附，无需下载；需要几秒钟。
en.Activating=Checking and enabling Aester
zh_CN.Activating=正在检查并启用 Aester
en.GimpFoundSame=GIMP 3.2.6 - already installed on this computer; it will be used as it is and not downloaded again
zh_CN.GimpFoundSame=GIMP 3.2.6 · 已检测到本机安装，将直接使用，不再下载安装
en.GimpFoundOther=GIMP - GIMP %1 is already installed and will be used as it is, not reinstalled. Aester uses GIMP 3.2.6; with a different version, compatibility is not guaranteed
zh_CN.GimpFoundOther=GIMP · 已检测到本机 GIMP %1，将直接使用、不再安装。Aester 使用 GIMP 3.2.6，版本不同时兼容性不能保证
en.GimpFoundUnknown=GIMP - an existing GIMP was found and will be used as it is, not reinstalled. Aester uses GIMP 3.2.6; with a different version, compatibility is not guaranteed
zh_CN.GimpFoundUnknown=GIMP · 已检测到本机 GIMP，将直接使用、不再安装。Aester 使用 GIMP 3.2.6，版本不同时兼容性不能保证
en.DiskSpaceEstimate=Current selection needs about %1 GB of disk space (runtime and download cache included).
zh_CN.DiskSpaceEstimate=当前选择约需 %1 GB 磁盘空间（含运行库与下载缓存）。
en.DiskSpaceEstimateGimpReused=Current selection needs about %1 GB of disk space (runtime and download cache included; the installed GIMP is not counted).
zh_CN.DiskSpaceEstimateGimpReused=当前选择约需 %1 GB 磁盘空间（含运行库与下载缓存；已安装的 GIMP 不计入）。
